## Part 1 — Restructure Admin Roles (HCD Division)

### Current State
The system has two `admin_roles`: **Evaluator** and **Verifier**.  
The seeder in `AdminRoleSeeder.php` seeds only those two roles.  
`AdminUserSeeder.php` seeds 4 admin users tied to HCD and Accreditation divisions.

### Required Changes

---

### Role 1: Team Lead

**Seeder**: In `AdminRoleSeeder.php`, add `Team Lead` to the roles array.

**User**: In `AdminUserSeeder.php`, change `hcdarms2026@gmail.com` from `Evaluator` role to `Team Lead` role. Update `first_name` / `last_name` to reflect this (e.g., `HCD` / `Team Lead`).

**Permissions & Behavior**:
- Can **create admins** (the only role with this privilege). The "Create Admin" button in `admins_list.blade.php` must be conditionally shown only to Team Lead.
- Can **view** all submitted applications, documents, and reports (read-only oversight).
- Can **assign an Evaluator** to an application via the decking system (see Part 2).
- **Cannot** evaluate applications (no access to evaluation actions/buttons).
- **Cannot** handle, schedule, or update interviews.
- **Cannot** generate or update recommendations/payments.
- **Receives** an email notification when a new application is **submitted** (heads-up before decking). After assigning an evaluator, all subsequent notifications go to the assigned Evaluator only. Team Lead does NOT receive any further process emails (e.g., document uploads, payment, interview, etc.).
- **Sidebar**: Same full sidebar as the current portal (Dashboard, My Profile, HCD Admin List, New Applications, Renewal/Reinstatement, Schedule Interviews, For Recommendation, Active FatPro, Revoked/Expired, Archived Applications). Reports section is **hidden** for Team Lead.

