## Part 4 — Email Notification Routing Fix

### Application Submission Emails (`RegistrationController.php` & `RenewalController.php`)

Currently, on application submission, the system sends `AdminApplicationSubmittedEmail` to **every admin with role Evaluator**.

**Change (confirmed)**: On application submission, send `AdminApplicationSubmittedEmail` to **all admins with role `Team Lead`** only. This is the heads-up notification before decking happens. After the Team Lead assigns an evaluator via the decking modal, all subsequent process emails (document uploads, payment, interview, recommendation, etc.) go **only to the assigned Evaluator**. Remove the current logic that sends to all Evaluators.

### NTC / Training Emails (`NtcController.php` and wherever `AdminNtcSubmittedEmail` / `AdminNtcReuploadedEmail` are dispatched)

**Change**: Send all NTC/training-related admin emails exclusively to users whose `adminProfile.adminRole.name === 'Training Evaluator'`. Remove any Evaluator targeting from these email dispatches.

**Files to update**:
- `RegistrationController.php` — application submitted email routing
- `Applicant/RenewalController.php` — renewal submitted email routing  
- `NtcController.php` — NTC evaluation/acknowledgment emails
- Any other controller that dispatches `AdminNtcSubmittedEmail` or `AdminNtcReuploadedEmail`

